# REPO SOVEREIGNTY RULE (Infinity Protocol)

## 1. SYNC MANDATE
- Always verify the remote URL matches `Infinity Protocol` before pushing.
- Execute `git push` after every major task completion.

## 2. BACKUP ALERT
- Identify if a project lacks a secondary backup strategy and PROPOSE one.

## 3. CLEANING
- Purge `.bak`, `tmp*`, and unused files before every sync.
